# The internal 700-question set, its answers, and the code that builds and validates it are kept OUT of this public repository
# on purpose. The repository is public and the live site serves every file in it, so committing them would publish the answer
# key (and get it scraped into model training data, which would make the benchmark meaningless).
/data/
/build.mjs
/validate.mjs
/lib/generators.mjs
/lib/exact.mjs
/out/benchmark-700.jsonl
/out/benchmark-meta.json
/out/MANIFEST.json
